{
    "title": "Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf2f Welcome to Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games! \ud83c\udf2f\ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf54\r\n\r\nStep into the bustling world of working games and culinary delights with Conveyor Rush! In this thrilling hypercasual idle game, you'll embark on a culinary adventure like no other as you manage your very own kitchen empire! Run your snack bar with the utmost efficiency and make sure all customers are satisfied in this restaurant game!\r\n\r\nSet in a bustling kitchen environment, Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games combines the thrill of working games, delivery games, and restaurant management games into one addictive package. Your mission? To get your pizza ready, burgers delivered and satisfy the hunger pangs of hungry customers!\r\n\r\nIn Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games the kitchen never sleeps, and neither do you! Keep those conveyor belts moving and those orders flowing to keep your customers happy and your profits soaring.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8 Rush against the clock: Feel the adrenaline of restaurant games as you keep pace with the fast-paced conveyors, each specializing in crafting a variety of mouthwatering treats! From fluffy donuts to cheesy good pizza, savory burritos, and juicy burgers, there's something to satisfy every craving!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\ud83c\udf1f Satisfy hungry customers: Serve up your freshly prepared culinary creations to a diverse array of customers, each with their own unique tastes and preferences. Keep them happy and coming back to your snack bar for more to earn lucrative rewards!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcbc Expand your kitchen empire: Start small and work your way up as you strategically invest in new conveyors, one by one. Upgrade your equipment, unlock exciting ingredients, and customize your snack bar to optimize production and maximize profits in working games!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d\ud83c\udf1f Idle gameplay: Even when you're not actively playing, your kitchen continues to churn out delectable treats! Return to collect your earnings, manage your restaurant games empire, and watch as your culinary empire flourishes!\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Join Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games and see if you have what it takes to become the ultimate food tycoon. Order please, get the pizza ready, and the snack bar is open for business!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf2f Welcome to Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games! \ud83c\udf2f\ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf54<br><br>Step into the bustling world of working games and culinary delights with Conveyor Rush! In this thrilling hypercasual idle game, you&#39;ll embark on a culinary adventure like no other as you manage your very own kitchen empire! Run your snack bar with the utmost efficiency and make sure all customers are satisfied in this restaurant game!<br><br>Set in a bustling kitchen environment, Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games combines the thrill of working games, delivery games, and restaurant management games into one addictive package. Your mission? To get your pizza ready, burgers delivered and satisfy the hunger pangs of hungry customers!<br><br>In Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games the kitchen never sleeps, and neither do you! Keep those conveyor belts moving and those orders flowing to keep your customers happy and your profits soaring.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8 Rush against the clock: Feel the adrenaline of restaurant games as you keep pace with the fast-paced conveyors, each specializing in crafting a variety of mouthwatering treats! From fluffy donuts to cheesy good pizza, savory burritos, and juicy burgers, there&#39;s something to satisfy every craving!<br><br>\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\ud83c\udf1f Satisfy hungry customers: Serve up your freshly prepared culinary creations to a diverse array of customers, each with their own unique tastes and preferences. Keep them happy and coming back to your snack bar for more to earn lucrative rewards!<br><br>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcbc Expand your kitchen empire: Start small and work your way up as you strategically invest in new conveyors, one by one. Upgrade your equipment, unlock exciting ingredients, and customize your snack bar to optimize production and maximize profits in working games!<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d\ud83c\udf1f Idle gameplay: Even when you&#39;re not actively playing, your kitchen continues to churn out delectable treats! Return to collect your earnings, manage your restaurant games empire, and watch as your culinary empire flourishes!<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Join Conveyor Rush: Idle Food Games and see if you have what it takes to become the ultimate food tycoon. Order please, get the pizza ready, and the snack bar is open for business!",
